flowchart TD
 A([Start Discovery Quiz]) --> B[Explain purpose and privacy]
 B --> C{User wants to participate?}
 C -->|No| D[Skip quiz and browse activities]
 C -->|Yes| E[Ask about interests]
 E --> F[Ask preferred activity style]
 F --> G[Ask preferred duration]
 G --> H[Ask sharing preference]
 H --> I[Summarise selected preferences]
 I --> J{User accepts summary?}
 J -->|No| K[Edit answers]
 K --> I
 J -->|Yes| L[Show relevant activity categories]
 L --> M[User chooses activity]
 D --> M
